# AIONIA Website

Sitio web corporativo de AIONIA - Transformando operaciones digitales

## Deployment

This project is configured for deployment with Docker using Nginx.

### Docker Build

```bash
docker build -t aionia-website .
docker run -p 80:80 aionia-website
```

### Dokploy Deployment

This repository is configured for automatic deployment to Dokploy using the included Dockerfile.
